    1	# Proposal Session — 2026-04-26 (Fresh, no prior-context)
    2	
    3	Goal: O(polylog(n)) exact computation of p(n).
    4	Constraint: do not look at CLAUDE.md / CLOSED_PATHS.md before generating.
