    24	characters across q in {3, 5, 7, 11, 13}.  Each char twists by a different
    25	primitive d-th root of unity for d = ord(chi) in {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 10, 12}.
    26	The next bit A_chi(x) mod 2 of every twisted sum is structurally
    27	pseudorandom (LFSR/N = 0.5000±0.0003 across all 34 chars) and has
    28	mutual info < 10^-5 bits with pi(x; q, a) mod 2 for every a in (Z/q)*.
